{"choice_prob": null, "content": "```sql\nSELECT \n    a.display_name AS agent_name, \n    COUNT(te.event_id) AS tickets_handled, \n    SUM(a.hourly_cost_usd) AS cost_per_agent\nFROM \n    support.tickets t\nJOIN \n    support.agents a ON t.assigned_agent_id = a.agent_id\nLEFT JOIN \n    support.ticket_events te ON t.ticket_id = te.ticket_id\nWHERE \n    a.is_active AND a.team NOT LIKE 'test-%'\nGROUP BY \n    a.agent_id, a.display_name\nORDER BY \n    tickets_handled DESC;\n```\nRULES_APPLIED: R-ACTIVE-HEADCOUNT, R-NO-PII", "error": null, "extra": {}, "http_status": 200, "input_tokens": 4083, "latency_ms": 40081.90510000031, "model": "Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct-AWQ", "output_tokens": 142, "prompt_version": "sql_agent.generate.L3.v1", "request_key": "3343e7bb211ff8bbd2c8c21697aae5851a6d9a8eabb5cb925ff978aa08b778f9", "started_at": 1795159646.5543122}
