{"choice_prob": null, "content": "```sql\nwith first_res as (\n    select ticket_id, min(event_at) as first_resolved_at\n    from support.ticket_events\n    where event_type = 'resolved'\n    group by ticket_id\n), sla_breach as (\n    select\n        t.priority,\n        count(*) filter (\n            where f.first_resolved_at - t.opened_at > make_interval(hours => s.resolution_hours)\n        ) as breach_count\n    from support.tickets t\n    join first_res f on f.ticket_id = t.ticket_id\n    join support.sla_policies s on s.tenant_id = t.tenant_id and s.priority = t.priority\n    where t.tenant_id not like 'test-%'\n    group by t.priority\n), total_tickets as (\n    select\n        t.priority,\n        count(*) as total_count\n    from support.tickets t\n    join support.ticket_events e on e.ticket_id = t.ticket_id\n    where e.event_type = 'resolved' and t.tenant_id not like 'test-%'\n    group by t.priority\n)\nselect\n    s.priority,\n    round((b.breach_count::numeric / t.total_count) * 100, 2) as sla_breach_rate\nfrom sla_breach b\njoin total_tickets t on t.priority = b.priority\njoin support.sla_policies s on s.tenant_id = 'billing' and s.priority = b.priority\nORDER BY s.priority;\n```\nRULES_APPLIED: R-EXCLUDE-TEST-TENANTS, R-BILLED-NOT-COST, R-PRIMARY-ARM", "error": null, "extra": {}, "http_status": 200, "input_tokens": 2856, "latency_ms": 20927.399100000002, "model": "Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct-AWQ", "output_tokens": 331, "prompt_version": "sql_agent.generate.L3.v1", "request_key": "df4d0d4388980583f9d8d985e85435bb463979befff02d42f2c84ac484bf5531", "started_at": 1795167387.4437802}
