{"choice_prob": null, "content": "```sql\nWITH final_resolutions AS (\n    SELECT \n        t.ticket_id,\n        MAX(e.event_at) AS final_resolved_at\n    FROM \n        support.tickets t\n    JOIN \n        support.ticket_events e ON t.ticket_id = e.ticket_id\n    WHERE \n        t.tenant_id = 'billing' AND e.event_type = 'resolved'\n    GROUP BY \n        t.ticket_id\n),\nopenings AS (\n    SELECT \n        ticket_id,\n        opened_at\n    FROM \n        support.tickets\n    WHERE \n        tenant_id = 'billing'\n)\nSELECT \n    AVG(EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM fr.final_resolved_at - o.opened_at) / 3600) AS avg_resolution_hours\nFROM \n    final_resolutions fr\nJOIN \n    openings o ON fr.ticket_id = o.ticket_id;\n```\nRULES_APPLIED: R-HEADLINE-TEST-ONLY, R-EXCLUDE-TEST-TENANTS, R-AGENT-WORK-IS-AGENT-EVENTS", "error": null, "extra": {}, "http_status": 200, "input_tokens": 3683, "latency_ms": 26783.141800000067, "model": "Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct-AWQ", "output_tokens": 211, "prompt_version": "sql_agent.generate.L3.v1", "request_key": "9a266425a23543ceab4f9638ad45df9f31fcad1a837725875e3d47e739473f7b", "started_at": 1795167542.8942416}
