{"choice_prob": null, "content": "```sql\nSELECT \n    t.tenant_id,\n    t.channel,\n    COUNT(*) AS churned_customers\nFROM \n    support.tickets t\nJOIN \n    support.ticket_events e ON t.ticket_id = e.ticket_id\nWHERE \n    t.tenant_id NOT LIKE 'test-%' \n    AND t.ai_predicted_intent IS DISTINCT FROM t.final_intent\n    AND e.event_type = 'closed'\n    AND e.event_at > (SELECT MIN(resolved_at) FROM (\n        SELECT \n            t2.ticket_id, \n            MAX(e2.event_at) AS resolved_at\n        FROM \n            support.ticket_events e2\n        JOIN \n            support.tickets t2 ON e2.ticket_id = t2.ticket_id\n        WHERE \n            t2.ai_predicted_intent IS DISTINCT FROM t2.final_intent\n            AND e2.event_type = 'resolved'\n        GROUP BY \n            t2.ticket_id\n    ) subquery WHERE subquery.ticket_id = t.ticket_id)\nGROUP BY \n    t.tenant_id, t.channel\nORDER BY \n    churned_customers DESC\nLIMIT 5;\n```\nRULES_APPLIED: R-EXCLUDE-TEST-TENANTS, R-PRIMARY-ARM, R-HEADLINE-TEST-ONLY", "error": null, "extra": {}, "http_status": 200, "input_tokens": 3724, "latency_ms": 8796.146800000315, "model": "Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct-AWQ", "output_tokens": 259, "prompt_version": "sql_agent.generate.L3.v1", "request_key": "e0b509a80792045a46a6894fd9653fafae3d4da3fcd416ac7f436cbfd695c492", "started_at": 1795168758.3961422}
