{"choice_prob": null, "content": "```sql\nwith first_res as (\n    select ticket_id, min(event_at) as first_resolved_at\n    from support.ticket_events\n    where event_type = 'resolved'\n    group by ticket_id\n)\nselect \n    t.priority,\n    count(*) filter (where f.first_resolved_at - t.opened_at > make_interval(hours => s.resolution_hours)) as breaches,\n    count(*) as total_tickets,\n    count(*) filter (where f.first_resolved_at - t.opened_at > make_interval(hours => s.resolution_hours)) / count(*) as sla_breach_rate\nfrom \n    support.tickets t\njoin \n    first_res f on f.ticket_id = t.ticket_id\njoin \n    support.sla_policies s on s.tenant_id = t.tenant_id and s.priority = t.priority\nwhere \n    t.tenant_id not like 'test-%'\ngroup by \n    t.priority\norder by \n    t.priority;\n```\nRULES_APPLIED: [R-RESOLVED-IS-STATUS], [R-EXCLUDE-TEST-TENANTS], [R-PRIMARY-ARM]", "error": null, "extra": {}, "http_status": 200, "input_tokens": 4077, "latency_ms": 18755.593799999588, "model": "Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct-AWQ", "output_tokens": 231, "prompt_version": "sql_agent.generate.L3.v1", "request_key": "604fd605533f94d285a9c0f807dd90f97c0e05e1a539c8e112c80c53d787ad70", "started_at": 1795179120.0127347}
